Z||000000||SilverFieroV6||09-13-2000||10:26 PM||||ok i started to take the heads off my car like two weeks ago, well i got everything off and changed the gaskets, and cleaned all the manifolds and valve covers.  well i  am ready to put on the upper pletnam but i am missing a (sensor or a bolt) i have 3 pics on a web page  if anyone would be able to help me out with what it is it would be greatly appreciated.<BR>Thank you <BR>Sam Clark<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fbody.com/members/redredconv/SamSensor1.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fbody.com/members/redredconv/SamSensor1.jpg</A>  <BR> <A HREF="http://www.fbody.com/members/redredconv/SamSensor2.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fbody.com/members/redredconv/SamSensor2.jpg</A>  <BR> <A HREF="http://www.fbody.com/members/redredconv/SamSensor3.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fbody.com/members/redredconv/SamSensor3.jpg</A>  <P>its the hole right next to the orange screwdriver handle<BR>||||reg||5
Z||000001||SilverFieroV6||09-13-2000||10:32 PM||||i think it might be the coolant temp sensor  but then what is the sensor right next to it???||||reg||1
Z||000002||V8Fiero||09-13-2000||10:50 PM||||I think that the sensor that you already have is the temp switch. This either controls the idiot light or the temp guage (depending on how your car is equipped. I think you might be missing the sensor that triggers the radiator fan when the temp gets to the appropriate temp.  Fellas? is this correct? <BR> Hope this helps.<P>Scooter||||reg||1
Z||000003||Blaster||09-13-2000||10:54 PM||||The sensor you are missing is the Fan Switch. I noticed that you have a broken coolant temp sensor on the side of the manifold.  You are going to want to replace that.  If that connector falls off, your will get a service engine light and you car will idle like crap.  Hope that was some help. Oh yea, and if you have a Bennett auto around ya, you can get an ACDELCO fan switch.||||reg||1
Z||000004||SilverFieroV6||09-16-2000||02:06 AM|||| Thanks for all the help.  it is the fan relay switch.  unfortunately the local auto store around here wont have one in untill thursday.<BR>Thanks again<BR>Sam Clark<p>[This message has been edited by SilverFieroV6 (edited 09-16-2000).]||||reg||10
